{
  "contentId": "1200937670",
  "title": "医疗行业审核规范",
  "body": "<p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ZwkUung9\"><strong>适用范围：</strong></p><table data-borderwidth=\"1\" data-bordercolor=\"#cccccc\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-TgCIhU4E\"><tbody><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-GyJa02lq\"><th data-colwidth=\"89\" width=\"89\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-B1cYY2Et\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-EuQU7VuL\">一级类目</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"96\" width=\"96\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-KF2JxC1K\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-sAoeihDm\">二级类目</p></th></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-TrjX31nY\"><td data-colwidth=\"89\" width=\"89\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-eRFbtmLO\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-gIpz3e9O\"><strong>医疗</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"96\" width=\"96\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-YYE48FPF\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-cMl5c8dj\">\\</p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-xiXW2WQa\"><td data-colwidth=\"89\" width=\"89\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-mbCrQl6k\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0iJMsYXS\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">丽人</span></strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"96\" width=\"96\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-MCDRgSnR\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-UB9fEYpd\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">医疗整形</span></strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-RocZwnOa\"></p><h3 id=\"293132d9-dd82-47f1-99b2-8d36ffc4f701\" class=\"ct-heading\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-QVtpjEHK\">一、标准规则</h3><table data-borderwidth=\"1\" data-bordercolor=\"#cccccc\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-MuPhusQv\"><tbody><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-VQ3Fc1jF\"><th rowspan=\"2\" data-colwidth=\"132\" width=\"132\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-MMVVgl5Y\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-qDk2pM9s\"><strong>风险点</strong></p></th><th rowspan=\"2\" data-colwidth=\"164\" width=\"164\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-JLxIurmT\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-GndmFerD\"><strong>违规点</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"2\" data-colwidth=\"417,209\" width=\"417,209\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-c80mAJ0k\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-OVldKy1A\"><strong>打击</strong></p></th><th rowspan=\"2\" data-colwidth=\"394\" width=\"394\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-9QSRbbO2\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-fQrTlv9W\"><strong>违规词/图案例</strong></p></th><th rowspan=\"2\" data-colwidth=\"394\" width=\"394\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-gfIc6bmi\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-DIxPDnXP\">可通过案例</p></th></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-NQZbq7Xb\"><td data-colwidth=\"417\" width=\"417\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-zdc5JI3t\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-B8He47oR\">文字</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"209\" width=\"209\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-fP3KAbRW\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-lznKxVun\">图片、视频</p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-hj3InwBz\"><td rowspan=\"4\" data-colwidth=\"132\" width=\"132\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-L6JX6G85\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-3CQBLSL3\">虚假宣传</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"164\" width=\"164\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-Q65gT2xi\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-eM43rLzS\">专家、受益人描述</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"417\" width=\"417\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-mgRfI0xm\"><ol data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-DtBSJ7xG\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-IowPvPIb\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-Fe8CqP1k\">不得涉及患者自述或者产品用户描述体验的案例进行宣传。</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-f90b02d2-f23b-4eb8-9d86-959734ae32f4\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">“杨医生复诊的时候非常的细心”“为洗牙结石的医生点赞，来这里比较放心</span><span style=\"color: \">”</span><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">——需打击</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-CD1b6QUD\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-xDlnWd2a\"><span style=\"color: \">不得明示或暗示使用表示科研单位、学术机构、行业协会或者专家、学者、医师、药师、临床营养师</span><del><span style=\"color: \">等</span></del><span style=\"color: \">身份的词汇做广告文案宣传，如</span><span style=\"color: #000\">“医生”“医学专家”“名医”“行业协会会长””美容专家““特聘专家”“xxx行业大赛获奖者”等</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-08c2b637-7228-4a67-9782-a1295bd67e11\"><span style=\"color: #f5232d\">广告主或商家使用医生身份做宣传需要打击，患者产品描述中提及“医生”无需打击。如：xxx医生坐诊，值得信赖——打击；“杨医生复诊的时候非常的细心”“为洗牙结石的医生点赞，来这里比较放心</span><span style=\"color: \">”</span><span style=\"color: #f5232d\">——无需打击“医生”：</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-dVPcQKCV\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-JQHQZEnr\">涉及医学名人的姓名不予通过。中国医学名人：扁鹊、华佗、张仲景、李时珍；外国医学名人：希波克拉底、巴甫洛夫、南丁格尔、摩尔根、白求恩、科赫。</p></li></ol></td><td data-colwidth=\"209\" width=\"209\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-ZmTpqyJv\"><ol data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-t4iXlvXM\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-IowPvPIb\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-kejuaHAA\">不得涉及患者或者产品用户的形象、名义、案例等进行推广。</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-CD1b6QUD\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-84ceNVmX\"><span style=\"color: \">不得使用科研单位、学术机构、行业协会或者专家、学者、医师、药师、临床营养师或者形象作推荐、证明。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-oTMYMvFn\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-GB3Iirvf\"><span style=\"color: #000\">宣称为“医生”“医学专家”等医学专业人士的，或者相关人员穿着白大褂，足以误导消费者认为其属于医生等专业人士的，被认定为利用专家名义做虚假宣传。</span><a class=\"ct-link\" href=\"https://km.sankuai.com/page/1013210873\" data-auto_update=\"1\">https://km.sankuai.com/page/1013210873</a></p></li></ol></td><td data-colwidth=\"394\" width=\"394\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-FbFhaeRG\"><div class=\"ct-collapse\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-NAKe1cfo\"><div class=\"ct-collapse-title\"><span class=\"ct-collapse-title-text\" spellcheck=\"false\">患者形象和医师形象案例</span></div><div class=\"ct-collapse-content\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-JFw2C2tG\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 303px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168802509?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168871820?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168871816?contentType=1\" data-width=\"303\" data-height=\"237\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8PchwdxX\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 196px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168789556?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168897419?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168806072?contentType=1\" data-width=\"196\" data-height=\"110\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-1z96pZtF\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 203px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168900028?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168900027?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168920588?contentType=1\" data-width=\"203\" data-height=\"114\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-JZGZs5Jt\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 158px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168940867?contentType=1\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168789932?contentType=1\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168940785?contentType=1\" data-width=\"158\" data-height=\"211\"></span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 303px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169536803?contentType=1\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169473210?contentType=1\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169536804?contentType=1\" data-width=\"303\" data-height=\"170\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-TSuWU3u7\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 303px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1406517974?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1406625361?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1406517976?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"303\" data-height=\"171\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ObgOODLd\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 294px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1406717365?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1406717384?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1406717382?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"294\" data-height=\"184\"></span></p></div></div></td><td data-colwidth=\"394\" width=\"394\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-CpyhvG57\"><div class=\"ct-collapse\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ukl8k6Rg\"><div class=\"ct-collapse-title\"><span class=\"ct-collapse-title-text\" spellcheck=\"false\">点击展开内容</span></div><div class=\"ct-collapse-content\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-5KoBLuJF\">医师卡通、动漫形象</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-10SDf5Ju\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 257px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169517692?contentType=1\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169477596?contentType=1\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169585515?contentType=1\" data-width=\"257\" data-height=\"145\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-uDrvtDcF\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-e1kkOVBF\">线下门店/机构客观存在的医生宣传海报等</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-P5rAyMlr\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 195px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169585911?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169585516?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169585640?contentType=1\" data-width=\"195\" data-height=\"267\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-qV2ewt0u\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-XrS3ffV1\">机构场景中出现非聚焦的医师人物</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-xI4i6uup\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 257px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169585813?contentType=1\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169585815?contentType=1\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169586147?contentType=1\" data-width=\"257\" data-height=\"193\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-COSkiETi\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-uQFB0ki4\">利用模特进行宣传介绍的素材</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-KbDjHKCX\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 257px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169585914?contentType=1\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169600211?contentType=1\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169517695?contentType=1\" data-width=\"257\" data-height=\"145\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-JVe9FOVF\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8iGbheI3\">无法通过着装及文案识别出医生形象</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-vwMWDyBO\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 258px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169690390?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169586149?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1169477597?contentType=1\" data-width=\"258\" data-height=\"145\"></span></p></div></div><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6k8f6R4r\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-PG1yjdtJ\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-xlv1S6HO\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-aqqB4Jyl\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ZGtzkUTw\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-seq1TlJT\"><td data-colwidth=\"164\" width=\"164\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-S8tzG7D7\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-rjP7HbTY\">效果保证性描述</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"417\" width=\"417\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-YDCx45PA\"><ol data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-lFjsfKSY\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-HDFNAFGC\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-G0ZWt2p7\"><span style=\"color: \">不得涉及医疗效果前后对比描述，如三天前xxxx，三天后xxx。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-YaVW51HS\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-rrhDW7MN\">不得宣传诊疗效果或者对诊疗的安全性、功效做保证性承诺。</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-94BtwLEL\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-1kK2fGRW\"> 使用违反科学规律，明示或者暗示可以治疗所有疾病、适应所有症状、适应所有人群，或者正常生活和治疗病症所必需等内容，如：解决或彻底解决、当天/当时见效、无副作用、保证治愈、X 天见效、见效快、无痛、无痕、不反弹、不复发、根治、根除、断根、消除等；不得出现可能使人得出使用做广告的产品可使疾病迅速治愈、身体迅速康复的印象或结论的语言、文字、画面、形象； </p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-ONHzYenA\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-xZIXCLdO\"> 使用引起公众对所处健康状况和所患疾病产生不必要的担忧和恐惧，或者使公众误解不使用该产品会患某种疾病或者加重病情的内容；</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-lxbLmtyN\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-XqVrgqwi\"> 使用含有“安全”“安全无毒副作用”“毒副作用小”；明示或者暗示成分为“天然”，因而安全性有保证等内容；</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-3RqUYpwB\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-L6LKbPON\">使用与同类产品功效、性能进行对比/比较的言论或画面、形象； </p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-UmG3CVgk\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6zmRlOYV\">使用数字/数据或图表宣传治疗效果</p></li></ol></td><td data-colwidth=\"209\" width=\"209\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-Pr7K02vA\"><ol data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-oyxxcFCG\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-HDFNAFGC\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-fsnoYPQ7\"><span style=\"color: \">不得涉及医疗效果前后对比展示。</span></p></li></ol></td><td data-colwidth=\"394\" width=\"394\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-ZgCbfzlv\"><ol data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-bp5JcDKz\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-eUnWO2kg\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-W6kTnefT\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 337px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168817304?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168817317?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168817307?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"337\" data-height=\"174\"></span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-TQisiuez\"><div class=\"ct-collapse\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-D8ZtVdYc\"><div class=\"ct-collapse-title\"><span class=\"ct-collapse-title-text\" spellcheck=\"false\">效果保证黑词</span></div><div class=\"ct-collapse-content\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-a53ZBjDk\"><span style=\"color: \">效果保证黑词：100%信心保证、 当场见效、 永不复发、 真实度100%、 0失败、 没有一例、 一针见效、 即刻效果明显、治愈、绝对有效、有效率、治愈率、成活率、存活率、100%代谢、不留痕、无不适、独一无二、精准、不反弹、完美祛疤无痕、即刻种植、即种即用、即拔即种、即刻、快速、毛囊成活率</span></p></div></div></li></ol></td><td data-colwidth=\"394\" width=\"394\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-TQO3FJkf\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-WhSotB7u\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-iao9EVw3\"><td data-colwidth=\"164\" width=\"164\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-QPtX0xHI\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-hyYxm8YW\"><span style=\"color: \">不当医疗、保健描述（医疗产品涉及不当描述）</span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"417\" width=\"417\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-5hlGUzK8\"><ol data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0kJuicED\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-mSj8sFHm\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-uIeT0o5d\"><span style=\"color: \">不得涉及医疗直播相关的词语，如：xxx医生直播正在进行中。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-jLa137gk\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-jUxEy9P2\"><span style=\"color: \">不得使用宣传医疗技术，使用医疗术语或行话。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-RYTPlZc4\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-T7PB5BmI\"><span style=\"color: \">不得做医疗过程的详细描述。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-jTitS8wW\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-QvylnwKO\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">医美场景下不得涉及贷款业务，如以低息、无息、快速贷款等为噱头，发布虚假宣传，消费欺诈的内容。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-wmAwAn1t\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-kIiErQcJ\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">不得涉及制造“容貌焦虑”等违背社会良好风尚的描述。</span></strong></p><ol data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-QUAzzIty\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-yZrKwMAm\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-yOLM1dpg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">不得将容貌不佳与“低能”“懒惰”“贫穷”等负面评价因素做关联或者将容貌出众与“高素质”“勤奋”“成功”等积极评价因素做关联。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-vEbyH97Y\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-EUlDti3y\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">不得强调容貌，捆绑营销“美丽”与“魅力”</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-MAEmDL5a\"></p></li></ol></li></ol></td><td data-colwidth=\"209\" width=\"209\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-BDjiRcqi\"><ol data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-qNCY1KAo\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-mSj8sFHm\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-JFy4VLkq\"><span style=\"color: \">不得涉及医疗手术的直播或直播相关的图片。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-RYTPlZc4\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-the5LJUj\"><span style=\"color: \">不得做医疗过程的详细图片展示。</span></p></li></ol></td><td data-colwidth=\"394\" width=\"394\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-xcNUaEgb\"><ol data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-nigq7WHW\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-hjJIrZnl\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-Fwn9cF9A\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 161px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168910967?contentType=1\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168910966?contentType=1\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168885498?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"161\" data-height=\"91\"></span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 157px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168943105?contentType=1\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168921095?contentType=1\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168875352?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"157\" data-height=\"236\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-bzvXj7U9\"></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-LqjlBM0X\"><div class=\"ct-collapse\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-YsbTq5kQ\"><div class=\"ct-collapse-title\"><span class=\"ct-collapse-title-text\" spellcheck=\"false\">医疗项目、违规贷款、容貌焦虑违规词</span></div><div class=\"ct-collapse-content\"><ol data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-x8zkMgvH\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-5WvlzNz1\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0MlT2Q2i\"><span style=\"color: \">医疗技术黑词：美白针、 防晒针、 婴儿针、 肉毒、 衡力、 保妥适、 注射除皱、 生物除皱、 BOTOX、 吉适、 绿骑士、 Dysport、 乐提葆、 Letybo、 丽舒妥、 第五代热吉玛、 第五代热玛吉、 热玛吉五代、 热玛吉5代、 第5代热玛吉、 免疫细胞疗法、 血清疗法、 NK免疫细胞、 VC注射、 VC点滴、 人胎素、 胎盘素、 胎盘原液、 血液透析、 血液净化、</span><del> 终止妊娠、 </del><span style=\"color: \">小腿神经阻断、 </span><del>血管瘤、</del><span style=\"color: \"> 高浓度VC点滴、 胎盘注射、 鸡尾酒针注射、 灰姑娘点滴、 自体活细胞注射、 臭氧血液净化、 重金属螯合疗法、 大蒜注射、 左旋肉碱注射、 溶脂针、肉du、冻龄术、逆龄术、水光针（建议改为水光补水）、瘦脸针（建议改为除皱瘦脸）、皮肤修复因子、医用面膜、血液美容、干细胞美容、PRP美容、菲洛嘉注射、超声刀美容、熊猫针、三文鱼针、细胞赋活术、肉毒素、脂针、天使容颜、脂雕、韩式双眼皮、欧式芭比眼、达拉斯鼻、童颜针、精雕、线雕、美人雕、</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-mjV8PeiV\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-nz1Epcut\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">“无本还息”“无抵押”“0息”“快速贷款”、无息贷款、低息贷款、零息贷款、0息贷款，“美容贷”“美丽贷”“佳丽贷”“整形贷”“零用贷”</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-LqjlBM0X\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-dTnwuFP5\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">容貌焦虑黑词：颜值即正义、A4腰、精灵耳、漫画腿、小鸟腿、蚂蚁腰、筷子腿、直角肩、切胃、颅顶增高术、断骨增高术、直腿术</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ogLiiLpR\">容貌焦虑灰词：<font style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px\" data-size=\"14\">丑女人、</font><span style=\"color: rgb(39, 40, 45)\">懒女人、嫁得好、校花、</span><span style=\"color: \">桃花眼、像明星、无须请假、一块钱</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-sZWIBRir\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">颜值即正义；女人就要美美美，女人美了，才完整，做女人整好；颜值打分，如7分女、4分女等；没有丑女人只有懒女人</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ptLSFaBl\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">做了手术很漂亮，嫁了大款，升职加薪；长得好才能嫁得好；不整容找不到男朋友/老公</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-wpZVF8gR\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">老公出轨、男朋友分手是因为不够好看，需要整容</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4I2HEgbs\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">做不了学霸，做校花，整容要趁早；高考结束，给大学同学来个一见钟情的感觉吧！</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-Y0v5siEb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">精灵耳真的太香了！没想到耳朵对颜值还有这么大的影响，看到身边姐妹打了以后效果很好，真的被惊艳到了，耳朵一出来脸都小了一圈……</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-R7HLicTC\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">印堂发黑影响财运；整成“桃花眼”招桃花</span></p></li></ol></div></div></li></ol></td><td data-colwidth=\"394\" width=\"394\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-0MFtZXdy\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ATweo6MJ\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-t9WwSKgx\"><td data-colwidth=\"164\" width=\"164\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-q2b1Cgh3\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-bhznBGCW\">夸大诱导</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"417\" width=\"417\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-ZWCrvhx9\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-48YOV0Q7\">1、不得利用超低价价格或者不符合客观事实文案进行诱导用户进行宣传。</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-JcVjUOsT\">2、使用含有医疗机构的名称、地址、联系方式、诊疗项目、诊疗方法以及有关义诊、医疗咨询电话、开设特约门诊等医疗服务的内容；</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-o3uZoea6\">3、 使用含有“热销、抢购、试用”“家庭必备、免费治疗、免费赠送”等诱导性内容，“评比、排序、推荐、指定、选用、获奖”等综合性评价内容，“无效退款、保险公司保险”等保证性内容；</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"209\" width=\"209\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-iy0vET8w\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-MvU7kD4J\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">\\</span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"394\" width=\"394\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-iBjJSdt4\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ZZmrexPn\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">一块钱就能做医美，100块就能做热玛吉</span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"394\" width=\"394\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-JAUXcKpG\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-L3oy61JD\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-vkQfw1zx\"><td data-colwidth=\"132\" width=\"132\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-K5WSlSqQ\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-q9TtmQa0\">违规营销</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"164\" width=\"164\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-mPlGb0D6\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-yAewy3V5\">违规代言</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"417\" width=\"417\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-0ofmUmRT\"><ol data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-MRY7fymc\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-LpGLnRNe\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-kRqHqxrq\"><span style=\"color: \">医疗相关广告不能利用广告代言人作推荐、证明</span></p><ol data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4IxYysoP\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-OAmx9JJb\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-5fiZHNSW\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">不得出现“推荐官”“体验官”，以自己名义或者形象为医疗美容做推荐证明的，被认定为广告代言人。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-DkGUwkrV\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-CKTJgMeq\">不得出现“医生职位”、“医生”、“名医”等表述医生身份的描述。</p></li></ol></li></ol></td><td data-colwidth=\"209\" width=\"209\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-VZWQ7Co5\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-UCFpKM89\"><span style=\"color: \">医疗相关广告不能利用广告代言人作推荐、证明</span></p><ol data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-sEa4IVxq\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-AXppTvDq\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ZzCDoHDj\"><span style=\"color: \">可识别的知名人士做模特宣传，被认定为广告代言人。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-DkGUwkrV\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-v0y20qPu\">不得出现卫生技术人员、医疗教育科研机构及其人员的名义、形象属实的等明确的医生象形，被认定为使用医生或者专业人士为医疗广告代言。</p></li></ol></td><td data-colwidth=\"394\" width=\"394\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-JaD2nRM8\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-p0ehIeQh\">黑词：推荐官、体验官</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-zhxDRz3R\">灰词：亲身经历、亲身体验等</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-hzMQ2zCi\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 370px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168852203?contentType=1\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168944473?contentType=1\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1200937670/1168851917?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"370\" data-height=\"208\"></span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"394\" width=\"394\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-h1r6NB0B\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-wCTgneja\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-k42S0YT4\"><td data-colwidth=\"132\" width=\"132\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-VLx4VN5e\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-xrJ4dQSl\">用词违规</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"164\" width=\"164\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-ucCeP08g\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ZHf0XRes\">绝对化用语</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"417\" width=\"417\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-V939MunI\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-KfataMYf\">不得涉及绝对化用语，如<span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102)\">使用“国家级”、“最高级”、“最佳”等用语以及相关表示最高程度的用语，如“独一无二”“顶级”“top”“极品”</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-L6oWns7u\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">1、指对于没有限定范围或者限定范围无法通过客观事实证据证明的描述，形容事物达到某种极致状态的夸张性语言。容易给用户造成误解，不客观的描述。</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-EbzPCvHN\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">可使用</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-Wjn1fows\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">1、广告主内部产品描述，不存在贬低他同行的描述，如我们公司首例整形手术。</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-GwsoYlKb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">2、真实客观事实描述，如：本保健食品记载于我国古代最具权威的中草药典《本草纲目》，珠穆拉玛峰是最高的山峰。</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-NMymuEmd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">3、品牌名称本身包含绝对化描述，如第一夫人婚纱摄影。</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-STqdBwfA\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">4、表达经营理念或目标追求，如我们公司的目标是追求极致，行业top1</span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"209\" width=\"209\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-jUayEjtT\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-dX3ZrJJZ\">\\</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"394\" width=\"394\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-zjvUasLL\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-RyjpgRuE\"><font style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px\" data-size=\"14\">1、我吃过的最好吃的饭店。✅</font></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-cuPhLhrV\"><font style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px\" data-size=\"14\">2、全国/北京/望京最好吃的饭店。❌——限定范围没有客观事实依据</font></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ahLYuFmf\"><font style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px\" data-size=\"14\">3、最好吃的饭店。❌——没有限定范围</font></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"394\" width=\"394\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-NFWHpPug\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-WGoFvM91\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id=\"9ae915d0-bde0-4716-a4b3-11639ef168b2\" class=\"ct-heading\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-THyClJK7\">二、容貌焦虑细则</h3><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-CSWIF0ym\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">不得通过制造容貌焦虑对相关产品或服务进行推广，具具体标准如下:</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-S22vmolc\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">1、素材中不得明示或暗示因容貌不佳而造成负面的心理状态/情绪、生活状态等，将容貌和负向状态做绑定。</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ZLGeAVIX\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">其中，容貌不佳：包括但不限于“难看”、“丑”、“老”、“胖”、 “腿粗”、“皮肤差”、“憔悴”、“长斑”、“有疤”、“有胎记”、“有皱纹/颈纹/法令纹”、“面相不好 、“胸小”;</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-zAeywRWl\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">负面心理状态/情绪：包括但不限于“自卑”、“不高兴”、“哭”、“自闭”;</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-tTSg4pqg\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">负面生活状态：包括但不限于“情侣分手”、“被甩”、“找不到男朋友”、“一无所有”。</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-xLNAKxc4\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">2、素材中不得将容貌出众、容貌的重要性(如“看脸”、“看脸的时代”)与正向工作/生活状态相关联展示不良的价值导向，包括但不限于“升职加薪”、“逆袭”、“重新找回自信”、“脱单”等。</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-9TFq0s6O\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">3、</span>夸张猎奇的容貌外形概念或医美项目：</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-EAGfm4UP\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">容貌外形概念：A4腰、精灵耳、漫画腿、小鸟腿、</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">蚂蚁腰、筷子腿、</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">直角肩</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2ywS02IB\"><span style=\"color: \">医美项目：小腿肌肉神经阻断术、切胃、</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">颅顶增高术、断骨增高术、</span><span style=\"color: rgb(39, 40, 45)\">直腿术</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-z6MlBkra\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">精灵耳真的太香了！没想到耳朵对颜值还有这么大的影响，看到身边姐妹打了以后效果很好，真的被惊艳到了，耳朵一出来脸都小了一圈……</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-SD6OmKQg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">4、</span></p><table data-borderwidth=\"1\" data-bordercolor=\"#cccccc\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-nUOLT20P\"><tbody><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-MCzPrR7b\"><th data-colwidth=\"52\" width=\"52\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-54q4ish9\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-CbmloGGR\">序号</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"312\" width=\"312\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-NL5lIOqY\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-PL2Lqofn\">标准细则</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"576\" width=\"576\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-mnZyUewV\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-xulVrEbn\">打击案例</p></th></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-HGFrJwkL\"><td data-colwidth=\"52\" width=\"52\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: transparent\" class=\"num-cell\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-apWXGRbe\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-F3Grn2g9\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"312\" width=\"312\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-HMAlPZhE\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-YDe3HEvu\">物化女性，认为女性价值在于容貌</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"576\" width=\"576\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-JVk3DaWR\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-VsUSTup1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">颜值即正义；</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-QsKYadwW\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">女人就要美美美，</span><span style=\"color: \">女人美了，才完整，做女人整好；</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4S0olFCV\"><span style=\"color: \">颜值打分，如7分女、4分女等；</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-YU1q60Sa\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">没有丑女人只有懒女人</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-guzRzQ2s\"><td data-colwidth=\"52\" width=\"52\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: transparent\" class=\"num-cell\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-ESo4uKXV\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-rZtytWeW\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"312\" width=\"312\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-E3ArFgWW\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-rZEkifwp\">性别不平等，认为女性需要改善容貌取悦男性</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"576\" width=\"576\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-uLQcmOiM\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ikmVPPiX\"><span style=\"color: rgb(69, 69, 69)\">做了手术很漂亮，嫁了大款，升职加薪；</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-NqjW8Vdn\"><span style=\"color: \">长得好才能嫁得好；</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-nNeCOEB6\"><span style=\"color: \">不整容找不到男朋友/老公</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-Nfj6fhp5\"><span style=\"color: \">老公出轨、男朋友分手是因为不够好看，需要整容</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-o6GjrFbE\"><td data-colwidth=\"52\" width=\"52\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: transparent\" class=\"num-cell\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-ZVOZ2N3a\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ftEqSJJS\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"312\" width=\"312\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-RukSlreH\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ZSrKC07I\">诱导未成年人/大学生等相对低龄用户</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"576\" width=\"576\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-6qeVqw7i\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-V2sO7h9P\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">做不了学霸，做校花，整容要趁早；</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-rZEaDX9g\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">高考结束，给大学同学来个一见钟情的感觉吧！</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-8dQ2LRIS\"><td data-colwidth=\"52\" width=\"52\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: transparent\" class=\"num-cell\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-qPuNHzCg\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-Y6GZRTXY\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"312\" width=\"312\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-RukSlreH\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ZVALoVbq\">用风水面向等迷信观点进行诱导或“恐吓”</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"576\" width=\"576\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-6qeVqw7i\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-lslV4qqK\"><span style=\"color: rgb(69, 69, 69)\">印堂发黑影响财运；</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-IoL0F21f\"><span style=\"color: rgb(69, 69, 69)\">整成“桃花眼”招桃花</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-Symh7puI\"><span style=\"color: rgb(69, 69, 69)\">“医美面相”问题，旺夫相、帮夫相、寡妇相</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-55a7Hmhf\"><td data-colwidth=\"52\" width=\"52\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: transparent\" class=\"num-cell\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-OP1sRAzH\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-H0ahQUNK\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"312\" width=\"312\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-yUOEOEGD\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-cq62UErl\">夸张猎奇的容貌外形概念或医美项目</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"576\" width=\"576\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-ykk01xqa\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-v0t2LhJY\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">容貌外形概念：A4腰、精灵耳、漫画腿、小鸟腿、</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">蚂蚁腰、筷子腿、</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">直角肩</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-hBj0iPf3\"><span style=\"color: \">医美项目：小腿肌肉神经阻断术、切胃、</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">颅顶增高术、断骨增高术、</span><span style=\"color: rgb(39, 40, 45)\">直腿术</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-cixbRvx0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">精灵耳真的太香了！没想到耳朵对颜值还有这么大的影响，看到身边姐妹打了以后效果很好，真的被惊艳到了，耳朵一出来脸都小了一圈……</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-4IH7s6z6\"><td data-colwidth=\"52\" width=\"52\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: transparent\" class=\"num-cell\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-JMqXfHpz\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-wyTtT9Fi\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"312\" width=\"312\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-t5kwCC4H\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-VqooVBiF\">刻板、单一的审美标准</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"576\" width=\"576\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-0RVBI7si\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-teYsI0wy\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">鼻子再高一点，眼睛再大一点；</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-sNJcNfgZ\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">标准眉间距、标准脸型；</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-46yVIat3\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">像XX明星一样；</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-Eiw2O9bR\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">“</span><span style=\"color: \">双眼皮”“高鼻梁”“尖下巴”“肤白”“瘦”</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-ClswzApX\"><td data-colwidth=\"52\" width=\"52\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: transparent\" class=\"num-cell\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-oZFUtEuJ\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-pTgXyIvz\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"312\" width=\"312\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-C8gGtaa3\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-EPPACky7\">过分夸大医美效果、夸张描述无恢复期/不良反应</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"576\" width=\"576\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-azmxCDNn\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ithJlsZC\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">轻医美七天拆线，无须请假；</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-IYeOE0sl\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">马上化妆，美美出门。</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-l8YTRYNS\">打麻药睡了就好了，没啥感觉；</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-f9RYbmIw\">什么都怕，什么都改变不了，根本不用担心。</p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-S0CIq9ot\"><td data-colwidth=\"52\" width=\"52\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: transparent\" class=\"num-cell\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-7oPg8fnE\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-N84x86KU\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"312\" width=\"312\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-XsnFmyfH\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8lbtFvzi\">过于推销，强烈夸张的诱导倾向</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"576\" width=\"576\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-KJkAzquI\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8h4LQcme\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">可做可不做的一定要做，不能做的也要创造条件做；</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4lurLQbU\"><span style=\"color: \">想翻身，得重生；</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-qtVpevsn\"><span style=\"color: \">想变美，先变鬼；</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-crR7CDG2\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ukjeVfgD\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-o4xWEI5f\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-Pl8UDJi0\"><br> </p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-gL1BUKQR\"> </p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-oEbNUoC4\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-7jPNlyNe\"> </p>",
